      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creepy Vision</strong> is an atmospheric indie horror game where the player finds themselves trapped in a mysterious and hostile dimension. Here, space is distorted, environments shift, and every mistake can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore unsettling locations, solve puzzles, and search for a path to freedom, relying on your perception, reflexes, and ability to adapt to a constantly changing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014560/extras/f13163eb46d0e81638fc94c940fa6ac2.avif?t=1769326508\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Atmospheric horror full of tension</strong><br>Dark environments, unsettling sounds, and a constant feeling of unease follow you at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Dynamic levels</strong><br>The environment can change as you progress, creating the sense of an unstable and living reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Puzzles and deadly traps</strong><br>You’ll need more than courage — observe carefully, think fast, and avoid lethal mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Minimalistic yet expressive visual style</strong><br>Distorted space and lighting enhance the feeling of anxiety and disorientation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Controller and multiple language support</strong><br>Play using different control methods with support for multiple languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🩸 <strong>Are you ready to escape?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step can bring you closer to freedom — or lead to your demise.<br><strong>Creepy Vision</strong> will test how long you can keep your composure in a world that doesn’t want you to leave.</p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creepy Vision</strong> is an atmospheric indie horror game where the player finds themselves trapped in a mysterious and hostile dimension. Here, space is distorted, environments shift, and every mistake can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore unsettling locations, solve puzzles, and search for a path to freedom, relying on your perception, reflexes, and ability to adapt to a constantly changing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014560/extras/f13163eb46d0e81638fc94c940fa6ac2.avif?t=1769326508\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Atmospheric horror full of tension</strong><br>Dark environments, unsettling sounds, and a constant feeling of unease follow you at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Dynamic levels</strong><br>The environment can change as you progress, creating the sense of an unstable and living reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Puzzles and deadly traps</strong><br>You’ll need more than courage — observe carefully, think fast, and avoid lethal mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Minimalistic yet expressive visual style</strong><br>Distorted space and lighting enhance the feeling of anxiety and disorientation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Controller and multiple language support</strong><br>Play using different control methods with support for multiple languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🩸 <strong>Are you ready to escape?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step can bring you closer to freedom — or lead to your demise.<br><strong>Creepy Vision</strong> will test how long you can keep your composure in a world that doesn’t want you to leave.</p>",
      "short_description": "Creepy Vision is an atmospheric indie horror with puzzles and dynamic levels. Explore a distorted dimension, avoid deadly traps, and find a way out while reality itself keeps changing around you.",
      "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
